{"version":1,"key":"card:159","content":{"id":159,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Canvas 中的坐标系统与数学中的坐标系统，起坐标原点为元素的左上角，x 轴的方向从左至右，y 轴方向从上至下"}]},{"type":"html-block","html":"<img style=\"display: block; max-width:100%; margin: 0 auto;\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/LastKnightCoder/ImgHosting3@master/坐标系统.55ak3s2eokc0.svg\" />","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于极坐标系，角度的增长沿顺时针方向，这是因为 y 轴向下导致的"}]},{"type":"html-block","html":"<img style=\"display: block; max-width:100%; margin: 0 auto;\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/LastKnightCoder/ImgHosting3@master/Canvas-极坐标系.6rpqzhey4340.svg\" />","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["Canvas"],"createTime":1690247704878,"updateTime":1743303640406,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640406},"pluginRenderers":[{"runtimeVersion":1,"manifest":{"formatVersion":1,"id":"tau.html","name":"HTML","version":"0.1.4","minAppVersion":"0.59.0","apiVersion":1,"platform":"desktop","format":"cjs","main":"main.js","editor":true,"categories":["editor","ai"],"keywords":["HTML","网页","嵌入"],"integrity":{"main.js":"eafe74429244b57e1dce6a889e1e925f0cf178f5942afe95485f081a8fa048bf","main.css":"468f2feb73a33e5711b1583b609e4ab3818e83d5f19a38dcd9d027b77eb269d8"},"styles":"main.css"},"entry":"../../plugin-assets/tau.html/0.1.4/7b4be5bc83e3b665c52aeaddc0c146d56eb1864201e835bf5ebaba71b8eb1536/main.js","styles":"../../plugin-assets/tau.html/0.1.4/7b4be5bc83e3b665c52aeaddc0c146d56eb1864201e835bf5ebaba71b8eb1536/style.css","nodeTypes":["html-block","html-inline"]}],"contentStyles":[{"href":"../styles/54a89023be83c8a0e9757be1a25e13b9874c28a06c3221b5d5a9bf021fb67a2d.css","integrity":"54a89023be83c8a0e9757be1a25e13b9874c28a06c3221b5d5a9bf021fb67a2d"}]}